      "content": "idk i really dont have time for a doctor right now lol. i just need to fix it. it's been a few days and it's definitely getting a bit bigger and more red. i have some extra strength hydrocortisone cream too, can i just mix that with the clotrimazole to speed things up? or maybe just take some ibuprofen to help with the warmth/inflammation?",
